{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dsh-doctor#card-zh","repo":"asdf17128/dsh-doctor","commit":"32d2bba1dc90d60be90a4e42fe0de788c74f980f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-doctor 是面向 DSH profile 的配置诊断插件，可作为命令行工具使用，也能在 DSH 中注册 config_doctor 工具，让 agent 检查当前 profile。它比较实际配置树与默认配置树，发现 patch 整块替换配置后丢失的字段、指向不存在条目的 patch、工具名称冲突、未挂载或长期未发布的第三方插件，并报告条目增删和启用状态。命令行还可查看配置树概况、输出 JSON、离线跳过 npm 查询，或补回部分丢失字段。适合排查设置未生效和升级前检查；需要 Node.js 18+ 与可用的 dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:25-64","src/audit.js:26-50","bin/dsh-doctor.js:118-160"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dsh-doctor#card-en","repo":"asdf17128/dsh-doctor","commit":"32d2bba1dc90d60be90a4e42fe0de788c74f980f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-doctor checks DSH profiles as a CLI or agent tool. It compares the composed tree with defaults to find dropped config fields, invalid patch targets, tool name collisions, and plugin mounting issues. The CLI can explain the tree or restore some dropped fields. Requires Node.js 18+ and dsh.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:25-64","src/audit.js:26-50","bin/dsh-doctor.js:118-160"]}
